nspeople think that he's a little  crazy because he's always talking about  conspiracy theories and vampires but if  you know anything about the real Mystic  Falls then you know he has a reason to  be concerned  Zach Rorick plays Matt on the show you  may know Zach from Friday Night Lights  he played the character cash he was also  on the soap opera as the world turns so  you might recognize him from that but  you probably didn't know about Zach  though is that he dated one of his  Vampire Diaries co-stars oh you would  like to know who well will tell you none  other than Natalie Kelly that's it for  10 things you didn't know about the cast  of CW TV show legacies were you  surprised by anything on the list let us  know in the comments  [Music]

